ARTWORK NOTICE

The MIT grant above covers the CODE only: lib/, cordis.patch.yml, package.json,
and the install scripts.

The artwork under media/ depicts the character Sigrika (西格莉卡) from the game
Wuthering Waves (鸣潮), whose characters and setting are the property of Kuro
Games (库洛游戏). The image files themselves are NOT original work either: they
were sourced from the internet, and their individual authorship is unknown.

They are included here for personal, non-commercial use and study only. This
project claims no rights over the character, the setting, or the images, and it
is not affiliated with or endorsed by Kuro Games.

If you are a rights holder and want this artwork removed, open an issue on the
repository and it will be taken down.

If you intend to redistribute this theme, replace the images under media/ with
your own or with properly licensed ones. Nothing in the code depends on the
current pictures: keep the four file names, or update the url(...) paths in
lib/client.js.

图片来源声明：media/ 目录下的图片描绘的是游戏《鸣潮》（Wuthering Waves）中的角色
「西格莉卡 Sigrika」，该角色及相关设定版权归库洛游戏（Kuro Games）所有。图片文件
本身亦非原创，来源于网络，作者不详。此处仅用于个人学习、研究与交流，不作任何商业
用途。本项目不对角色、设定及图片主张任何权利，与库洛游戏无隶属或背书关系。
如有侵权，请提交 issue 告知，将立即删除。MIT 许可仅覆盖代码部分；如需再分发本主题，
请自行替换为原创或已获授权的图片。
